00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:11.890
Lucian, nothing stands in our way now.

2
00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:15.890
Lucian, give me the pendant.

3
00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:27.290
Steady, Duke Valmont. She's just blinded by ambition right now.

4
00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:31.630
She'll figure out what you were trying to do, and back to you.

5
00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:35.630
Be a Trix. You just made the smartest play of your life.

6
00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:39.630
You are hereby sworn into my ranks.

7
00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:42.630
Welcome to my elite wings.

8
00:00:43.630 --> 00:00:47.630
Together, you two are going to rewrite the history books.

9
00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:49.630
The honor is ours, my lord.

10
00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:51.630
Congratulations, your grace.

11
00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:56.630
To secure two prodigies in a single day, it is unprecedented.

12
00:00:56.630 --> 00:00:59.630
As for you, Casprian, take comfort.

13
00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:04.630
You may have lost a prodigy daughter, but you gained yourself a loyal cur.

14
00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:07.630
And you needn't even trouble yourself over his future.

15
00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:10.630
Because someone like him was born for nothing.

16
00:01:10.630 --> 00:01:19.930
They aren't worth your breath, Duke Valmont.

17
00:01:19.930 --> 00:01:23.930
Even a nobody like me knows you don't turn your back on the people who feed you.

18
00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:25.930
I will never forget what House Valmont did for me.

19
00:01:25.930 --> 00:01:28.930
Come on, let's get out of here.

20
00:01:28.930 --> 00:01:32.930
Finally, I just cut two dead weights off my neck. I'm completely free.

21
00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:34.930
What a fitting end to their pathetic story.

22
00:01:34.930 --> 00:01:37.930
And a perfect beginning for us, my love.

23
00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:52.360
The hell is happening to the crystals? Why is it reacting so violently?
